,"entry_revision_identity":"4861735fc49a0dc4826abda85991b55b1afcece275bb67b07c9a810c717d439a","logical_entry_identity":"976dae1905d1d201e2bb3f054158b9638959b0c590f2956cb10f806014413cc3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Chat message filters#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#聊天消息过滤器#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fc3262930ea8d5b5286a3306a794c8f07e8a0d036174f15515afb20d56a0a4fb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4865903377f7adcbee3628b2e77937bd2f92e905fa436b717c623644329228d8","logical_entry_identity":"25cfc5503dd27c4d0a57b482f33ecc96ac0dd8309b08cde4a58e22df8838400d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hits the target with your weapon, doing %d%% damage. If the attack hits, the target's Accuracy is reduced by %d for %d turns.\n\t\tAccuracy reduction chance increases with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用武器攻击目标，造成 %d%% 伤害。若攻击命中，目标的命中降低 %d 点，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t命中削减的成功几率受物理强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c9006939de18a1b20bea49e55782cd66a31763e9c8f4d2cf47be86e391ecd8e2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"486677a19573ee204d5fbe01b9574ffa625b4d210b94ca6ec509f41f2c663b40","logical_entry_identity":"33cefdefd04b9f93a22007d0e68a36a4adbad968acc651ed09efa9c62de7ccde","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Undead are humanoids (Humans, Elves, Dwarves, ...) that have been brought back to life by the corruption of dark magics.","source_tag":"_t","target":"不死族是被黑暗魔法复活的人形生物（人类，精灵，矮人…）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fee7bff6a964f6cc2de9b4065aea227ca1183752ae91fcc3fd4251a9a879f1c8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"486819c25118d117acefacdde807e1587836ea5b5c4846ac6d6711fc23cb982f","logical_entry_identity":"05d35d319af84c75a58cb6a62277f63c100424d5f45fe43c7af954d27e789873","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Suppose you're an archmage, and you blast somebody with the Flameshock spell. \n\nThis spell does fire damage, which is determined by your #LIGHT_GREEN#Spellpower#WHITE#. #GOLD#Combat stats#WHITE# are not used to mitigate damage, so the defender is going to take the full force of the spell, barring fire resistance (which is a subject for another tutorial).\n\nThe spell will also attempt to stun the target. Stunning, you recall, is a physical effect, so the target defends with their #LIGHT_GREEN#Physical save#WHITE#. However, unlike the previous example, the source of this stun is a spell. You will thus compare your #LIGHT_GREEN#Spellpower#WHITE# to the target's #LIGHT_GREEN#Physical save#WHITE# to determine the success of the stun.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"假如你是一个元素法师，你用火焰冲击打击某个目标。\n\n法术造成的火焰伤害由你的 #LIGHT_GREEN#法术强度#WHITE#决定。\n#GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 并不是用来减轻伤害的，所以防御者会受到全部法术伤害，\n实际受到伤害量与火焰抗性相关（这是另一个教程的主题）。\n\n法术另外也会尝试震慑目标，说起震慑你会回想起来这是一个物理效果，所以目标\n以 #LIGHT_GREEN#物理豁免#WHITE# 来计算。\n然而和前面的例子不同，震慑的来源是一个法术，所以你用你的 #LIGHT_GREEN#法术强度#WHITE# 与目标的\n#LIGHT_GREEN#物理豁免#WHITE# 来决定震慑的成功率。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"589234cd3533ed9fab94b7873dde36fcbd01d37dd5f24cce0d345c5b0a89288e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"486f0cf49beb46513edfbc4d4601ba75427a79cb5d085f9aa96b664e770ed845","logical_entry_identity":"6d98e240a835c27c4cec6f6b681fd4b47ad43f9196fc437160e3fa974abb5d99","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is wreathed in shadows, increasing life regeneration by %0.1f","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标沐浴黑暗，增加 %0.1f 生命回复"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c9c49e98e61ffab86cb9a70c232ac6bb680265a3cd7c3d946d5de32058be114d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"486fee5604cb4c18360d7f6312f568d81e18cfbb3227470c591fd55f8daad076","logical_entry_identity":"5c42defda48c73d3dcc2a5d01860425296532120bae5c432c4e1e9f667193a27","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic immune blind","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 致盲免疫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e94c22d6536d9ea2446dd853bd215f4d00282e8416c887957f1589973a5a6e5","component":"tome","entry_revision_id